; the symbols of a theory that comes with Kurt can't be declared anew: that would change how
; its axioms read (soundness review of 2026-09-29: `bool Nat`, `arity Nat 2`, `infix Nat 50 50`
; were accepted, and afterwards `0 ∈ Nat` no longer parsed)
load natural, analysis
expect "EvalError"
    bool Nat
expect "EvalError"
    arity Nat 2
expect "EvalError"
    infix Nat 50 50
expect "EvalError"
    infix abs 50 50
expect "EvalError"
    prefix Nat 50
expect "EvalError"
    postfix Nat 50
0 ∈ Nat

; a symbol of its own is fine
infix foo 50 50
